          },
          "title": "Spouse was born before January 2, 1961. A person reaches age 65 on the day before the 65th birthday. A spouse who was born before January 2, 1961 but died in 2025 before reaching age 65 is not included.",
          "declared_default": "parameter.default-false v1",
          "default_value": false,
          "default_applies": false,
          "input_questions": [
            {
              "id": "input-question.spouse-over-65",
              "version": "v1",
              "question": "Was your spouse born before January 2, 1961? A person reaches age 65 on the day before their 65th birthday. If your spouse died in 2025 before reaching age 65, answer no. On a separate return, answer yes only if your spouse also had no income, isn't filing a return, and can't be claimed as a dependent on another person's return."
            }
          ]
